PICS 0
BACnet Protocol Implementation Conformance Statement

Vendor Name: "LG Electronics"
Product Name: "CDU"
Product Model Number: "KSSU500CO20"
Product Description: "BACnet/IP implementation in LG CDU Products."

BIBBs Supported:
{
        DS-RP-B
        DS-WP-B
        DS-COV-B
        DM-DDB-B
        DM-DOB-B
        DM-DCC-B
}

BACnet Standard Application Services Supported:
{
        ReadProperty               Execute
        WriteProperty              Execute
        SubscribeCOV               Execute
        ConfirmedCOVNotification   Initiate
        UnconfirmedCOVNotification Initiate
        DeviceCommunicationControl Execute
        Who-Has                    Execute
        Who-Is                     Execute
        I-Have                     Initiate
        I-Am                       Initiate
}

Standard Object-Types Supported:
{
        Device
        Analog Input
        Analog Output
        Binary Input
        Binary Value
        --Network Port
}

Data Link Layer Option:
{
        --BACnet/IP
}

Character Sets Supported:
{
        --ISO 10646 (UTF-8)
}

Special Functionality:
{
        Maximum APDU size in octets: 1476
}

